tb: (Turbine: def"
A turbine is a device that resolves linear fluid motion into mechanical energy.
Its function is governed by the causal relationship: (FD) = (ME);)
(input: fm, fr;)(output: mv, rpm)
(type:
(ww: (water wheel: def"
A passive turbine driven by ambient liquid flow. No pressure vessel.
Resolution is open-air flow into shaft torque.;)
(dimensions: radius, width, blade count, shaft radius, shaft length, slave radius, slave width;)
(equation: FD:ambient = ME:pulley))
(wt: (wind turbine: def"
A turbine that resolves ambient wind (fluid momentum) into rotational mechanical energy.
Operates in an open field configuration.;)
(dimensions: radius, blade count, slope, material, shaft radius, shaft length, slave radius, slave width;)
(equation: FD:ambient = ME:rpm))
(ht: (hydraulic turbine: def"
A pressure-driven turbine using a contained liquid (typically water) to drive an impeller in a housing.;)
(dimensions:
(housing: inside diameter, outside diameter, outside height, inside height, inlet, outlet, material;)
(impeller: radius, blade count, blade width, blade height, shaft radius, shaft height, material;)
(slave:(pulley: radius, width, depth, material;(gear: radius, width, teeth count, teeth depth, material;)))
(equation: FD:pressurized = ME:shaft)))
(pt: (pneumatic turbine: def"
A turbine driven by compressed air, using an enclosed impeller to resolve pressure into rotation.;)
(housing: inside diameter, outside diameter, outside height, inside height, inlet, outlet, material;)
(impeller: radius, blade count, blade width, blade height, shaft radius, shaft height, material;)
(slave: (pulley: radius, width, depth, material;)(gear: radius, width, teeth count, teeth depth, material;)
(equation: FD:compressed_air = ME:rpm);))